# This package is database-agnostic and currently defines no environment
# variables of its own. It reads no config directly; the consuming
# application (IAM, Support, Bookings, HubOps, ...) owns its own DATABASE_URL
# and other env vars, and passes a ready repository implementation into
# UserRbacModule.forRoot({ ... }).
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder for env vars this package may need in
# a later phase (e.g. token expiry, cache TTLs for authorization checks).
